{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>An unfit lip for a fool</b> — not desirable, and not fitting for him." "<b>A lip of excess</b> — that is, he does not desire the counsel of the lip of the wise that would bring him to excess. But for a noble it is not desirable, that is, the noble does not desire the lips of a lying man, as the fool desired."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:23:18.066895822Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}